Constant Value Meaning <code>ACCOUNT_TRADE_MODE_DEMO</code> <code>0</code> demo / practice <code>ACCOUNT_TRADE_MODE_CONTEST</code> <code>1</code> contest <code>ACCOUNT_TRADE_MODE_REAL</code> <code>2</code> real trading <pre><code>import { AccountHelperPb } from '@metarpc/nodemt4';
const T = AccountHelperPb.EnumAccountTradeMode;
const s = await account.accountSummary();
if (s.getAccountTradeMode() === T.ACCOUNT_TRADE_MODE_REAL) console.log('⚠️ REAL account');
</code></pre> <p>The <code>TradeStats</code> methods take no input enum — only a <code>from</code> timestamp — and their <code>*Data</code> fields are plain numbers.</p>

Parameter Type Description <code>req</code> <code>TradeStatsRequest</code> Set the window start with <code>setFromUtc(isoUtcString)</code> (UTC) — or <code>setFrom(isoUtcString)</code> for broker server time. <pre><code>const req = new TradeStatsPb.TradeStatsRequest();
req.setFromUtc(new Date(Date.now() - 30 * 864e5).toISOString());   // last 30 days (UTC)
</code></pre>

JS accessor Type Description <code>getMode()</code> <code>number</code> (enum) <code>OrderCloseDeleteMode</code> — <code>OCD_MARKET_ORDER</code> (<code>0</code>) market order closed · <code>OCD_PENDING_ORDER</code> (<code>1</code>) pending order deleted. <code>getHistoryOrderComment()</code> <code>string</code> The resulting history order's comment. <p><code>getMode()</code> is an enum result on <code>TradingHelperPb.OrderCloseDeleteMode</code>:</p> <pre><code>enum OrderCloseDeleteMode {
  OCD_MARKET_ORDER  = 0;  // a market order was closed
  OCD_PENDING_ORDER = 1;  // a pending order was deleted
}
</code></pre>

Method Returns Purpose <code>connect(login, password, server)</code> (or a <code>ConnectOptions</code>) <code>Promise&lt;boolean&gt;</code> Start / re-attach a terminal (ConnectEx by broker server name). <code>getId(user?, password?)</code> <code>Promise&lt;string&gt;</code> The terminal session id (defaults to the last connect's). <code>reconnect()</code> <code>Promise&lt;boolean&gt;</code> Re-run the last connect (same id/name). <code>checkConnect()</code> <code>Promise&lt;boolean&gt;</code> Liveness probe — <code>true</code> when the terminal answers. <code>isConnected()</code> <code>boolean</code> Sync flag after a successful connect. <code>disconnect(deleteTerminal?)</code> <code>Promise&lt;void&gt;</code> Stop the terminal (<code>true</code> also deletes it) and close the channel. <code>close()</code> <code>void</code> Close the channel without touching the terminal. <pre><code>import { MT4Service } from '@metarpc/nodemt4';

const service = MT4Service.create('mt4.mrpc.pro', 443);   // apiKey from MRPC_API_KEY, else TRIAL
await service.connect(500000, 'password', 'TeleTrade-Demo');
// … use it …
await service.disconnect(true);   // free the trial terminal slot
</code></pre>

Option Default Meaning <code>trailPips</code> <code>20</code> Distance of the trailing stop behind the bid, in pips. <code>cycles</code> <code>8</code> How many times to re-evaluate. <code>intervalMs</code> <code>700</code> Delay between cycles, ms. <pre><code>// override defaults when calling the function directly
await trailingStop(sugar, cfg, { trailPips: 30, cycles: 20, intervalMs: 1000 });
</code></pre>
